# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# experiments/ — the SL architecture study (see experiments/README.md)
#
# Tracked: the code, the generated experiment scripts, and the per-run RECORDS
# (manifest / epochs / final / test_eval / command). Those are the audit trail.
# Ignored: bulk artefacts that are either large or regenerable. The split lists
# are deterministic from --seed and every one carries a SHA-256 in its
# manifest.json, so re-running build_splits.py reproduces them byte-for-byte.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
experiments/splits/*/*.txt
experiments/results/*/stdout.log
experiments/results/*/scores/
experiments/results/*/script.py
experiments/results/*__smoke/
experiments/results/*__dev/
experiments/results/*.superseded-*/
experiments/queue_logs/
experiments/analysis/figures/

# config.yaml inside a run directory is a per-run artefact, but the blanket
# *.yaml rule above already covers it; the same content is in manifest.json
# under resolved_parameters.
!experiments/splits/*/manifest.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Added 2026-10-07, completing the experiments/ block above.
#
# Pretrained SSL encoder weights — 720 MB across two files, fetched from
# their upstream publishers rather than authored here.
# tools/fetch_ssl_encoder.py re-downloads them.
models/weights/
*.safetensors

# results_backup/ is the pre-rebuild snapshot from 2026-08-22. Its per-run
# RECORDS are kept as history; its score archives are not, for the same
# reason the live tree's are not (rule above: experiments/results/*/scores/).
# 280 .npz files, 56 MB, all regenerable from a checkpoint.
experiments/results_backup/*/*/scores/
experiments/results_backup/*/*/*.npz
*.npz

# Per-run model directories: checkpoints and TensorBoard events.
exps/*/model/
exps/*/logs/
events.out.tfevents.*
